    "title": "Cozad Church of Christ Hosts Free Oil Change - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago The Cozad Church of Christ held its annual free oil change event for widows, widowers, single mothers, and veterans on Saturday, Oct. 11. Spearheaded by Randy and Jill Arnold, the servanthood project began in 2008 and serviced 28 vehicles this year. Volunteers changed oil, installed new air filters, and refilled antifreeze and washer fluid in each vehicle. Pictured are members of the morning crew, from left, Mike Hill, Sam Arnold, Gloria Kloepping, Jill Arnold, Randy Arnold, Paul Lauby, Sue Lauby, and Connie Schmeeckle. Not pictured but assisting in the afternoon were Pat and Henry Potter, Pastor David Haynes, Adam Bossert, Mark, Kim, Gage, and Mayla Sutherland, Janice Johnson, and Nick Cullers. (Courtesy Photo) Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
